      "num": 4, "topic": "devoted-to-truth-not-money", "start": 472.40, "end": 514.10,
      "title_lead": "Devoted to Truth,", "title_main": "Not to Money",
      "subs": [
        ["Once, during a lesson,", 0.2, 2.0],
        ["a sparrow flew past", 2.0, 3.5],
        ["with a coin in its beak.", 3.6, 6.0],
        ["It slipped and fell.", 6.1, 7.6],
        ["\u201cLord Rama has given this \u2014", 7.6, 9.3],
        ["keep it toward the debt,\u201d", 9.4, 11.2],
        ["said Satyaparayana.", 11.3, 12.6],
        ["A disciple sitting far off", 12.6, 16.0],
        ["said to someone near him:", 16.1, 18.1],
        ["\u201cHe didn't even spare a coin", 18.2, 20.8],
        ["dropped by a sparrow!", 20.9, 22.6],
        ["He only cares about money.", 22.7, 25.2],
        ["Not Satyaparayana \u2014", 25.3, 26.5],
        ["Vittaparayana!\u201d", 26.5, 27.6],
        ["Vitta means money.", 27.7, 29.4],
        ["Yet he had no wish for money,", 29.5, 30.9],
        ["not to keep, not to enjoy.", 31.0, 34.2],
        ["It was so Rama's grand worship", 34.3, 37.2],
        ["might bless every devotee", 37.3, 40.1],
        ["who came to see it.", 40.2, 41.5]
      ],
      "caption": {
        "title": "Devoted to Truth, Not to Money \ud83d\ude4f | Madhwa16",
        "description": "When a sparrow dropped a coin during a lesson, Sri Satyaparayana Teertha said, \"Lord Rama has given it \u2014 put it toward the debt.\" A disciple mocked him: \"Not Satyaparayana (devoted to truth) \u2014 Vittaparayana (devoted to money)!\" But he wanted nothing for himself. Every coin was for Lord Rama's worship, so devotees could see it and be blessed. \ud83d\ude4f From \"Glory of Shri Satyaparayanateertharu\" (Sri Uttaradimath Adhyatmavani).",
        "description_kn": "\u0c97\u0cc1\u0cac\u0ccd\u0cac\u0cbf\u0caf \u0cac\u0cbe\u0caf\u0cbf\u0c82\u0ca6 \u0cac\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6 \u0ca8\u0cbe\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0c95\u0cbe\u0ca3\u0cc6\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc2 \u0cb8\u0cbe\u0cb2\u0c95\u0ccd\u0c95\u0cc6 \u0c87\u0ca1\u0cb2\u0cc1 \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cbf\u0ca6 \u0c97\u0cc1\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c92\u0cac\u0ccd\u0cac \u0cb6\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf \u201c\u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0caf\u0ca3\u201d \u0c8e\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0c9f\u0cc0\u0c95\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0ca6. \u0c86\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc6 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0ca6\u0cc1\u0ca1\u0ccd\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0ca8 \u0c86\u0cb8\u0cc6 \u0c87\u0cb0\u0cb2\u0cbf\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2 \u2013 \u0c8e\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cb5\u0cc2 \u0cb0\u0cbe\u0cae\u0ca6\u0cc7\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0cb5\u0cc8\u0cad\u0cb5\u0ca6 \u0caa\u0cc2\u0c9c\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf. \u201c\u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cc0 \u0cb8\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0caf\u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0caf\u0ca3\u0ca4\u0cc0\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0ca5\u0cb0 \u0cae\u0cb9\u0cbf\u0cae\u0cc6\u201d \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb5\u0c9a\u0ca8\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c82\u0ca6.",
        "hashtags": "#Madhwa16 #Satyaparayanateertha #SriRama #Guru #Detachment #SriUttaradiMath #Adhyatmavani #Pravachana #Dvaita #SanatanaDharma #HinduWisdom #Devotional #Shorts",
